  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until lightly browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the ginger and garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the garam masala, turmeric, cumin powder, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lentils, tomato puree, and 4 cups of water. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and cook until the lentils are tender, about 20 minutes.",
    "Heat some oil in a separate pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the frankfurter and cook until lightly browned, about 2 minutes on each side.",
    "Add the cooked lentil mixture to the frankfurter and stir to combine.",
    "Stir in the low-fat yogurt and season with salt to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
